<title>TANZANIA: Tanzania shilling weakens against dollar, pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzania shilling weakens against dollar, pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling weakened against the dollar and pound on Thursday.</p>
<p>The shilling traded at a commercial mean rate of 598.0689 to the dollar, from 597.9600 on Wednesday, and at 972.1640 against the pound from 965.1105 on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
